{"styles":[{"sc":"#ff2600","so":1,"w":2,"ol":true,"fc":"#fffb00","fo":0.502}],"cards":["<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;max-width:238px;\"><div style=\"background:#0e7d46;height:6px;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:7px 0 0;\">COUNTY BOUNDARY</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0 0 2px;\">ARIZONA</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 0 6px;\">Greenlee County</div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;\"><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Population</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">9,312 (2025 est.)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">County Seat</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">Clifton</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Land Area</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">1,843 sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Density</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">5 / sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Household Income</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$71,200</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Home Value</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$158,600</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#333333;padding:8px 0 2px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f1;margin-top:7px;\">Greenlee County has the smallest population in Arizona at roughly 9,300 residents across 1,843 square miles. The Morenci copper mine, one of the largest in North America, dominates county employment, tax base and housing to a degree with few parallels; company-influenced housing in Morenci sits alongside the private market in Clifton, the county seat, and Duncan. Median household income of $71,200 is the highest in this group and reflects mine wages, while median home value is $158,600 — an unusually low price-to-income ratio. Transaction volume is very thin and county-level statistics carry wide margins of error, so single-mine employment conditions are the primary variable for any exposure here.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: August 21, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["Greenlee",0,[[32.42651,-109.04795],[32.4264,-109.05683],[32.42629,-109.09112],[32.42648,-109.11497],[32.42669,-109.11516],[32.42681,-109.11573],[32.42679,-109.1163],[32.4267,-109.11674],[32.42672,-109.11706],[32.42729,-109.11781],[32.42749,-109.11821],[32.42766,-109.11916],[32.4282,-109.12016],[32.42887,-109.12117],[32.42911,-109.12195],[32.42905,-109.12235],[32.42915,-109.12296],[32.42968,-109.1233],[32.43008,-109.12374],[32.43025,-109.12422],[32.43024,-109.12532],[32.43013,-109.12601],[32.43026,-109.12659],[32.43057,-109.1272],[32.43067,-109.12752],[32.4306,-109.1285],[32.4305,-109.12873],[32.42995,-109.12908],[32.42962,-109.12949],[32.42976,-109.1296],[32.4305,-109.12966],[32.43096,-109.13009],[32.43222,-109.13099],[32.43304,-109.13124],[32.43381,-109.13091],[32.43447,-109.13006],[32.43486,-109.12947],[32.4355,-109.12924],[32.4363,-109.12906],[32.43646,-109.12922],[32.43664,-109.12982],[32.43694,-109.13032],[32.4377,-109.13123],[32.43815,-109.13166],[32.43892,-109.13203],[32.43906,-109.13253],[32.43881,-109.13317],[32.43878,-109.1336],[32.43891,-109.13426],[32.43928,-109.13519],[32.44009,-109.13582],[32.44038,-109.13613],[32.4414,-109.13744],[32.44164,-109.13791],[32.44205,-109.13832],[32.44308,-109.13862],[32.44386,-109.13907],[32.44451,-109.13993],[32.44518,-109.14035],[32.44552,-109.14062],[32.44611,-109.14085],[32.44797,-109.14191],[32.44936,-109.14